== Mersenne primes by Lucas-Lehmer ==
2^p - 1 is prime fer p in [2, 3, 5, 7, 13, 17, 19, 31, 61]
2^61 - 1 = 2,305,843,009,213,693,951 - prime, an' proved
2^64 - 1 cannae even be built: Wheesht! Yer number's too muckle at line 315 - it's overflowed!

